OL,3,GNEWSAAnger and frustration as 15th
OL,4,ACentury ship set to remain in storage
OL,5,
OL,6,FCampaigners say they are "angry and
OL,7,Ffrustrated" that a medieval ship
OL,8,Fdiscovered in Newport nearly 25 years
OL,9,Fago is still no closer to being given a
OL,10,Fpermanent home.
OL,12,FThe 15th Century Newport Ship was found
OL,13,Fin 2002 in the muddy riverbank of the
OL,14,FUsk during construction of the
OL,15,FRiverfront Theatre in the city centre.
OL,17,FBut councillors are expected to confirm
OL,18,Fthe ship will continue to be kept in
OL,19,Fstorage for the foreseeable future,
OL,20,Fgiven the estimated #27.5m cost of
OL,21,Fbuilding a permanent display venue.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,433,430,260,140,0,100
