OL,3,GNEWSAAnger and frustration as 15th
OL,4,ACentury ship set to remain in storage
OL,5,
OL,6,FAnother factor is the "very limited
OL,7,Favailability" of a suitable site in
OL,8,FNewport, although the council says its
OL,9,Flong-term ambition is "to enhance
OL,10,Fpublic interpretation of the ship".
